---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site.mjs';
---
<Layout title="Privacy and cookies" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data: no accounts, no tracking cookies, and what your browser stores.`}>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
    <h1>Privacy &amp; cookies</h1>
    <p class="lede">Short version: no accounts, no tracking cookies, no advertising.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Very little. There are no accounts or sign-ups and no advertising trackers.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Visitor counts:</b> Vercel Web Analytics and Speed Insights count page views and measure load times without cookies and without identifying you.</li>
      <li><b>The contact form:</b> if you send a message, it is delivered to us by email through Web3Forms, including your name and email address only if you choose to give them. We use them only to reply.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What your browser stores</h2>
    <p>The site keeps a few small settings in your own browser's storage, never sent to us:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>players you follow, so their matches can be highlighted for you;</li>
      <li>your predictor picks, guess-the-player results and checkout trainer best;</li>
      <li>your light or dark theme and TV sync delay.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Clearing your browser's site data removes them.</p>
    <h2>Other services</h2>
    <p>Live scores and results load straight from the PDC's public data feeds, our pages are hosted by Vercel, and contact messages go through Web3Forms. Like any website, those services see your IP address when your browser talks to them; none of them sets cookies on this site.</p>
    <h2>If this changes</h2>
    <p>If {SITE.name} ever adds tracking or advertising, this page will be updated first and you'll be asked for consent before any non-essential cookies are set.</p>
    <p class="muted">Last updated 22 November 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
